Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.58,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:18.09,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of\Ndeception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:46.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate\Nthe face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,When our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,On your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.87,0:01:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.44,0:01:43.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't you think you're overestimating\Nthat PKF-spec cybernetic body?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.99,0:01:45.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's long past its expiration date.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.59,0:01:47.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's of no advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.59,0:01:50.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Despite that, you still think you'll win?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.29,0:01:52.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.36,0:01:57.79,Sign - Copy,,550,0,500,,{\b1}Rout{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:39.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The only way to knock out a cybernetic\Nbody with its pain receptors shut off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:40.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,is to cause trauma to the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.23,0:03:00.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.21,0:03:28.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you an ex-Ranger?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:29.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So what if I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.51,0:03:31.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:34.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The only reason I won must be due to\Na small difference in our motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:38.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have something I still have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:40.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:43.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:03.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You know where he went?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.73,0:04:04.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:25.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:46.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bastard...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:47.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's a remote control corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:52.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:54.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you trying to kill me, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:55.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.85,0:04:57.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,With improvements in firing control software,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.95,0:05:00.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have pinpoint accuracy that's\Nbetter than yours, Saitou-San.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.25,0:05:03.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:05.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.02,0:05:08.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When was this guy's frontal lobe burned out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:10.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:13.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Besides, even though it's obvious\Nthat he's a remote control corpse,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:16.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,how the hell are the signals\Nreaching all the way down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:20.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Maybe they used that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:30.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.36,0:05:34.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's up with their movements?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:35.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are they both unmanned?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:37.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.17,0:05:47.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where's Batou?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:49.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He went after Kuze.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.57,0:05:50.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're going after them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:55.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why were the armour suits here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:58.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There's no reason that the\NGSDF would intervene in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:00.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What about Coyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.32,0:06:02.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Saitou-San is after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:02.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:09.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:10.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou-San!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:11.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What happened, Batou?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.15,0:06:15.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:16.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:23.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.76,0:06:24.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:26.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I underestimated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:27.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hurry up and go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.06,0:06:29.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bomer and the others will be along shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:30.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.06,0:06:31.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.53,0:06:37.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.03,0:06:39.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:47.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hurry up and launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.69,0:06:48.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll have company soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.69,0:06:53.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He seems to have left the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.29,0:06:57.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After you guys went to finish the\Ndeal, he disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:06:59.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:16.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kuze...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:17.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Cover me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:41.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.33,0:08:17.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's headed for Nagasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:18.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We will recover Batou
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:20.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and pursue them with the tilt-rotor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:21.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:37.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:39.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou-San!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.26,0:08:42.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you okay, Batou-San?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:44.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Forget about that; where's the Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.06,0:08:52.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The camouflaged ship left port.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:54.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're going after them on the tilt-rotor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:56.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Get Batou inside a Tachikoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:02.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It seems Coyle's frontal\Nlobe was fried a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.76,0:09:06.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He was probably already a remote control corpse
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:08.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,by the time Russian authorities\Nstarted tailing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:10.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In any case, by the time we arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:13.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,neither Jablov nor Kagazaki were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:16.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The armour suit pilot was\Nalso a remote control corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.06,0:09:20.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He was either a Sagawa employee or a local labourer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.56,0:09:23.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The suit is also one that was\Nnever delivered to the GSDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:26.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This deal has another side to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:30.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This might provide a clue as\Nto where Kuze got the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.76,0:09:35.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It looks like his source provided\Nan unbelievable sum of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:36.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.76,0:09:38.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That investigation will wait till later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:39.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.56,0:09:54.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll have company soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:55.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's head towards Shikotan for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:58.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The same ship as ours should have\Nalready departed from Dejima.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.56,0:10:00.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll wait till our people arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:02.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,then slip through the Coast Guard's net.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:06.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll be in trouble if those guys come from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:08.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll prep the anti-aircraft guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:25.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:35.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They got you, Old Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:37.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm fine. Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:38.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll depart immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.90,0:10:40.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're going after Kuze's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:48.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa, shake him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.57,0:11:07.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.57,0:11:08.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A suicide bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:08.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:30.94,Dialogue,,800,0,325,,{\b1\i1}Houeimaru{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:11.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Lead...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:19.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.16,0:12:24.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Seems he stopped them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:24.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.36,0:12:28.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Were the authorities aware of the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:30.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Could've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:32.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But we got the plutonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:34.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:37.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now that we have this, Dejima will become our nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:40.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.06,0:12:42.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's not get optimistic yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.36,0:12:45.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At least, not until we get it to Dejima.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.56,0:12:46.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:49.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, I have a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:50.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:53.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I will go to Dejima alone from here on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You guys will get off the ship at Shikotan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:13:01.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But the Coast Guard's patrol ships\Nwill be showing up ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:04.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How about we go by land, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:06.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We may be able to deceive the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.56,0:13:07.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:09.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We can't enter Dejima by land.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:11.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We can only go by sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.16,0:13:14.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Besides, it's more effective to\Nslip past the Coast Guard's net
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:18.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and bring in the plutonium in\Norder to declare independence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:21.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll become a nuclear power\Nafter our demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:24.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In the end, nuclear weapons are a deterrent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.26,0:13:25.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're not something we can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.06,0:13:28.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If that's the case,\Nthen all the more reason for us to go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.46,0:13:31.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What're you going to do by yourself if\Nyou get in a scuffle with the Coast Guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:34.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can survive by myself
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.36,0:13:36.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and I {\i1}will{\i} bring the plutonium back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:38.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But if you're with me, you'll be in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:49.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Since you've been so blunt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:50.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I guess we can only have faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:14:00.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Three million refugees are\Nwatching me in real-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.54,0:14:02.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can't go back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:10.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is that a Hokkaido Police chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.64,0:14:13.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's almost like déjà vu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:16.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If I remember right, didn't we see\Nsomething identical yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:20.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.74,0:14:23.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou and Ishikawa's rescue\Nwill be your first priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:26.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And as for the Coast Guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.24,0:14:27.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sorry but you'll be dealing with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:31.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm going to take Pazu and\NBomer to investigate Sagawa--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:33.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,there's something that bothers me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:34.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:37.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If the plutonium went to Kuze,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:40.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the Coast Guard is the last line of defence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:41.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:45.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Several identical camouflaged ships\Nhad already been built in Dejima.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:47.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Have them be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:49.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Considering the distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:54.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I think it'll be a few days before he passes through\Ninternational waters and shows up on Nagasaki's coast, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:14:55.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:15:00.07,Dialogue,,0,825,200,,{\b1\i1}Sagawa Electronics{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.14,0:15:01.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.00,0:15:09.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, were we planning on\Nhaving photographers over?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:11.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, are you suffering from amnesia or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:13.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's the girl who's going to\Ninherit the Uesawa Photo Studio;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.90,0:15:16.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we've been doing business\Nwith them for forty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:22.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Refugees, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.72,0:15:24.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This place is too mechanised.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:27.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Maybe they can't survive with\Nonly specialised talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.02,0:15:32.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You guys hit up the information processing\Nroom and the memory management room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:34.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll go to the president's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.92,0:15:37.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If this deal was staged by the\NCabinet Intelligence Agency,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:41.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,there is a high possibility that\Nthe plutonium didn't go to Kuze.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:42.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I want to find proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:46.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Eighty to ninety percent of Gouda's\Nplans have already gone through,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.62,0:15:50.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but he plans to fabricate the "fact" that\Nthe refugees became a nuclear power first,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.62,0:15:53.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make the SDF deployment certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:55.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We will find something and go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.82,0:15:56.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:16:00.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If this continues,\Nwe'll have a civil war with the refugees,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:03.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and his plan to have the current regime\Nexpand the military will succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:08.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Still, how will you end the refugee problem, Gouda?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.40,0:16:27.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It must be Kagazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.20,0:16:30.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It looks like this one was a temporary body,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:34.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He tried to switch to his main body and escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:36.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but got killed anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:43.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,These must be Jablov and his man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.62,0:16:47.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mechanising this place was their undoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.32,0:16:50.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Like Chlordane, they were killed\Nwithout anyone's knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.89,0:16:55.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Everything has been deleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.89,0:16:59.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chlordane's data is now our only lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.29,0:17:02.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Pazu, Bomer, report.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.59,0:17:05.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Only records about the company are left here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:08.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,There are traces of massive\Namounts of data that were deleted,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.79,0:17:10.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but recovery looks to be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:12.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.79,0:17:13.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.29,0:17:18.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Judging from the situation, this deal seems to have\Nbeen under the Cabinet Intelligence Agency's control,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.69,0:17:21.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but there is no proof that the\NAgency was controlling Coyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:24.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After we record data from this\Nsite, we'll return to HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.59,0:17:25.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:29.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Gouda's still holding us\Nall in the palm of his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.17,0:17:35.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What will you do, Kuze?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:51.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.83,0:17:55.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's just that it doesn't feel like a\Npart of me when it's only been three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:00.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How's the old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:04.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fortunately, his brain functions are\Nshowing no signs of abnormalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:07.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He'll be on his feet in a month or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:11.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We've sustained a lot of damage in this sortie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.12,0:18:13.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We lost a man, with one more injured;
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:18.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we also lost the tilt-rotor.\NWe can pretty much call it a total defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:24.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kuze's camouflaged ship hasn't shown itself yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:27.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It hasn't shown up on the Coast Guard's net yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:30.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The government hasn't made\Nany noticeable moves, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.92,0:18:33.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The refugees are lying low for now as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.82,0:18:39.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so the consensus is that there isn't\Nenough reason to deploy the SDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:41.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Though unofficially,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:45.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the Chinese government appears to be concerned\Nas to how to deal with the autonomous region.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.22,0:18:47.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Autonomous region?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.72,0:18:49.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Considering that they wouldn't take in refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:51.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,what a selfish attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.12,0:18:54.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The fact that Kayabuki is pro-China\Nmay be what's emboldening
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:57.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the Chinese side's remarks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.13,0:19:01.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,For now, only a select few in the Coast Guard
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.53,0:19:06.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,know that there may be plutonium\Non the camouflaged ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:10.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but it seems Diet members, like\NKanzaki, have caught onto the situation
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.13,0:19:12.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,through their own information networks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.93,0:19:13.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As a result,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:18.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we should consider it fact that there are many\Nwithin the ruling party who are aware of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:22.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder if the reason that Chief Cabinet Secretary\NTakakura hasn't done anything, despite the circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.33,0:19:26.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,is because the obstacle to\NSDF deployment will be removed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.43,0:19:27.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,if plutonium is brought into Dejima,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.93,0:19:31.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in accordance with the Cabinet\NIntelligence Agency's scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.03,0:19:33.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:36.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It looks like there are places on the net
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.93,0:19:39.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,where they're starting to\Nyammer about the possibility
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.73,0:19:45.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that there was a plutonium deal between\Nthe Russian mafia and the refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:48.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How will the refugees make their move?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.93,0:19:52.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If the plutonium didn't go to\NKuze, as the Major speculates,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.53,0:19:54.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,what do you think Kuze will do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:20:00.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He has been orchestrating the\Nsituation with his rare charisma
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.73,0:20:05.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and his ability to take action\Nand assess the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.53,0:20:07.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but in the end, he's only one terrorist among many,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.13,0:20:10.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in terms of both strategy and force.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.53,0:20:13.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Gouda has the upper hand, with the state's backing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.43,0:20:18.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As a result, Kuze's actions\Nfollow Gouda's scenario,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.73,0:20:23.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and Kuze is playing a role that changes\Nthe situation in the direction Gouda wants,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.23,0:20:26.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but it's not as though Kuze is\Nactually under Gouda's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:30.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If there is a factor that\Nmay overturn the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.61,0:20:33.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kuze's actions may be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.91,0:20:35.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Strange how things are turning out,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:40.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but this may also be what the\NStand Alone Complex makes possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.80,0:20:47.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Chief, a report just came in
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:49.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,that a Coast Guard patrol ship
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:52.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,found a camouflaged ship\Nbelieved to have Kuze on board
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.30,0:20:56.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,off the shores of Nagasaki in Amakusanada.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:20:59.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are they keeping us informed of the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.90,0:21:03.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, we have a live feed from the patrol ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.80,0:21:05.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Connect it to this monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.60,0:21:06.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:14.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The ship's not stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.63,0:21:16.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Warning shots won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.03,0:21:18.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bring her closer to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.73,0:21:19.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.33,0:21:20.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bring her closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.73,0:21:22.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Prepare to fire on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.43,0:21:25.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.49,0:21:29.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did we hit her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:30.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.59,0:21:31.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Affirmative, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:40.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're shooting at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.15,0:21:43.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.05,0:21:45.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Starboard! We've taken damage to starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.15,0:21:47.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're being attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.85,0:21:49.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Prepare to fire in self-defence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.25,0:21:50.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.35,0:21:51.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Fire, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.95,0:21:55.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.85,0:21:57.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Avoid the fuel tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.35,0:21:59.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What if the plutonium blows up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:01.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.03,0:22:04.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This footage will go to the media, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.53,0:22:06.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The ship seems to have a fire on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.53,0:22:08.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Detain the ship's crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.13,0:22:09.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bring her closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.75,0:22:15.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Get her closer and catch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.35,0:22:17.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.27,0:22:24.47,Default,,1150,0,667,,{\fs35}{\i1\b1}Coast Guard{\i0\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.75,0:22:19.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.25,0:22:20.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.55,0:22:21.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.75,0:22:22.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Nagasaki is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.65,0:22:24.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Nagasaki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.76,0:22:25.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.56,0:22:26.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The lights are going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.87,0:22:37.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.43,0:22:43.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The refugees triggered a massive\Nblackout with a terrorist attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.63,0:22:45.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,To cover for Kuze, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.83,0:22:49.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It is difficult to believe that the refugees\Nwould be able to accomplish that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.33,0:22:50.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Huh? Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.83,0:22:53.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At the end of the chain reaction of hate
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.63,0:22:56.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,is a drawn-out war with the refugees...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.66,0:23:10.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.01,0:23:14.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.11,0:23:17.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.46,0:23:21.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.26,0:23:25.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:28.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.06,0:23:32.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:34.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.86,0:23:36.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.69,0:23:39.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.45,0:23:39.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.97,0:23:41.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.63,0:23:43.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.23,0:23:46.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is right)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:47.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:48.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:51.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.20,0:23:49.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:54.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.60,0:23:55.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.90,0:23:57.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.57,0:23:58.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.99,0:23:59.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.97,0:24:01.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.55,0:24:03.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.97,0:24:06.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.25,0:24:08.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:07.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.53,0:24:12.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.75,0:24:10.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.95,0:24:14.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.07,0:24:15.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.37,0:24:16.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.80,0:24:16.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,all I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.62,0:24:19.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.92,0:24:22.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.77,0:24:25.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,right here within the shell.
